sequenceDiagram
    participant DSP as Data Science Pipelines<br/>(Pipeline Orchestrator)
    participant MLMD as ml-metadata Server<br/>8080/TCP gRPC HTTP/2
    participant DB as MariaDB/MySQL<br/>3306/TCP

    Note over DSP,DB: Flow 1: Pipeline Metadata Recording

    DSP->>MLMD: PutArtifactType(request)<br/>gRPC/8080
    MLMD->>DB: INSERT artifact_type<br/>MySQL wire protocol
    DB-->>MLMD: type_id
    MLMD-->>DSP: PutArtifactTypeResponse(type_id)

    DSP->>MLMD: PutExecutionType(request)<br/>gRPC/8080
    MLMD->>DB: INSERT execution_type<br/>MySQL wire protocol
    DB-->>MLMD: type_id
    MLMD-->>DSP: PutExecutionTypeResponse(type_id)

    DSP->>MLMD: PutExecution(execution)<br/>gRPC/8080
    MLMD->>DB: INSERT execution<br/>MySQL wire protocol
    DB-->>MLMD: execution_id
    MLMD-->>DSP: PutExecutionResponse(execution_id)

    DSP->>MLMD: PutArtifacts(artifacts)<br/>gRPC/8080
    MLMD->>DB: INSERT artifacts<br/>MySQL wire protocol
    DB-->>MLMD: artifact_ids
    MLMD-->>DSP: PutArtifactsResponse(artifact_ids)

    DSP->>MLMD: PutEvents(events)<br/>gRPC/8080
    Note right of MLMD: Links artifacts to executions<br/>(INPUT/OUTPUT events)
    MLMD->>DB: INSERT events<br/>MySQL wire protocol
    DB-->>MLMD: OK
    MLMD-->>DSP: PutEventsResponse

    Note over DSP,DB: Flow 2: Lineage Query

    DSP->>MLMD: GetLineageSubgraph(query)<br/>gRPC/8080
    MLMD->>DB: SELECT artifacts, executions,<br/>contexts, events<br/>(graph traversal)
    DB-->>MLMD: Result rows
    Note right of MLMD: Assembles lineage subgraph<br/>from query constraints
    MLMD-->>DSP: LineageSubgraph(artifacts,<br/>executions, contexts, events)
